{"data":{"itemList":[{"address":"安徽省黄山市黄山区黄山风景区","category":"山湖田园","description":"莲花峰是黄山的第一高峰，因其俊俏高耸，气势雄伟，宛如初绽的莲花，故名。其实古人一直认为天都峰是最高峰，直到1618年，徐霞客游黄山时，指出莲花峰“居黄山之中，独出诸峰上”，才为莲花峰的地位正名。\n莲花峰上有飞龙、双龙等奇松和月池、香沙池等名胜。登上峰顶，如置身云霄。云天一色，江河一线，俱在远眺之中。","freePoiStatus":"NOT_FREE","id":"20262847","jumpUrl":"https://router.feizhu.com/multi/webview?url=https%3A%2F%2Frouter.feizhu.com%2Fws%2F14a8IT","latitude":"30.124656","listRank":null,"longitude":"118.17077","mainPic":"https://img.alicdn.com/tfscom/TB1vqHbim_I8KJjy0FoSuuFnVXa","name":"莲花峰","poiLevel":null,"ticketInfo":null},{"address":"安徽省黄山市黄山区黄山风景区内","category":null,"description":"","freePoiStatus":"UNKNOWN","id":"193241250","jumpUrl":"https://router.feizhu.com/multi/webview?url=https%3A%2F%2Frouter.feizhu.com%2Fws%2F4e2D7f","latitude":"30.124657","listRank":null,"longitude":"118.170774","mainPic":"https://gw.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/O1CN01hFBLsd1gbKeNllvAe_!!6000000004160-0-tps-1440-1080.jpg","name":"黄山-莲花峰","poiLevel":null,"ticketInfo":null}]},"message":"success","status":0,"systemMessage":null}
